    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a platform action game in which you control light and rely on it to move forward in a world shrouded in darkness. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the light to go from place to place and illuminate the buried truth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most of the stage is darkness with zero visibility, and you can only see fireballs and a small area around yourself. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the fireball to check safety, footholds, and the path you should take as you move forward.</p>",
